  # - "V2: 新增 ReModelTrainDevicePart 实体 @ ReModelTrainDevicePart.java:28-69"
  # - "V3: 修改 WsWorkOrder.repairPartIds 标注为冷备份字段 @ WsWorkOrder.java:153"
